cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Real-Time SOC Dashboard — Suricata × Wazuh"
abstract: >-
  A real-time Security Operations Center dashboard that correlates Suricata IDS
  network signatures with Wazuh SIEM host telemetry, categorises four attack
  classes (scan, brute force, DoS, exploit delivery), maps them to MITRE ATT&CK,
  and computes detection accuracy, false-positive rate and Mean-Time-To-Detect
  with repeated-run confidence intervals.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-28"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - SOC
  - Suricata
  - Wazuh
  - intrusion detection
  - MITRE ATT&CK
  - SIEM correlation
